Yeu cau hien tai:

- Backend Flask API.
- Frontend React/Vite.
- Database MySQL, khong dung SQLite.
- Schema MySQL nam trong `database/schema.sql`.
- Admin phai dang nhap moi vao duoc dashboard quan tri.
- Check-in thanh cong se tao chung chi, gui email kem chung chi va ghi `email_logs`.

Chay database:

```powershell
Get-Content database/schema.sql | & "C:\Program Files\MySQL\MySQL Server 8.0\bin\mysql.exe" -u root -p
```

Chay backend:

```powershell
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
python seed/seed_data.py
python app.py
```

Chay frontend:

```powershell
cd frontend
npm.cmd run dev
```
